{"rows_added":[],"rows_removed":[],"rows_changed":{"1142":{"Text":["So undisputably delectable is this squid that it is served in every restaurant and food stall found along the coasts of Thavnair. Whilst extolling its virtues when both fried and dried, locals often add that a dragoon from a distant land once purchased a veritable starship's worth.","So indisputably delectable is this squid that it is served in every restaurant and food stall found along the coasts of Thavnair. Whilst extolling its virtues when both fried and dried, locals often add that a dragoon from a distant land once purchased a veritable starship's worth."]},"1512":{"Text":["","Named an \u201cenvoy of rainbows\u201d in the Hanuhanu tongue, this fish gleams in seven distinct colors. Its scales are as popular as precious stones when it comes to decoration due to their brilliance and luster."],"Item":["0","52012"],"GatheringItemLevel":["0","645"],"Unknown1":["0","7100"],"FishingSpot":["0","301"],"FishingRecordType":["0","3"],"IsInLog":["False","True"]},"1513":{"Text":["","Blooms of these jellyfish can be found off the docks of High Tide Harbor. When dried, their durability and elasticity make them valued packaging amongst traders."],"Item":["0","52013"],"GatheringItemLevel":["0","650"],"Unknown1":["0","7100"],"FishingSpot":["0","296"],"IsInLog":["False","True"]},"1514":{"Text":["","Exceedingly agile, this shrimp bears a name evocative of rust and deadly shears. Its tight ruddy-brown carapace conceals flesh bountiful in nourishment."],"Item":["0","52014"],"GatheringItemLevel":["0","655"],"Unknown1":["0","7100"],"FishingSpot":["0","309"],"FishingRecordType":["0","3"],"IsInLog":["False","True"]},"1515":{"Text":["","Squid native to the waters beneath Zorgor the Boundless. While the Tonawawta have used its ink as pigment since days of eld, its flesh is considered inedible by even the most ambitious epicureans."],"Item":["0","52015"],"GatheringItemLevel":["0","665"],"Unknown1":["0","7100"],"FishingSpot":["0","321"],"FishingRecordType":["0","5"],"IsInLog":["False","True"]},"1516":{"Text":["","This remarkable species breathes by means of lungs, perhaps due to the shoals where it resides. Exhalations are summarily absorbed by the body, which creates enough carbonic acid to trigger a popping noise upon exposure to air."],"Item":["0","52016"],"GatheringItemLevel":["0","675"],"Unknown1":["0","7100"],"FishingSpot":["0","324"],"FishingRecordType":["0","2"],"IsInLog":["False","True"]},"15843":{"Item":["0","52096"],"GatheringItemLevel":["0","10"],"FishingRecordType":["0","44"]},"15844":{"Item":["0","52097"],"GatheringItemLevel":["0","10"],"FishingRecordType":["0","44"]},"15845":{"Item":["0","52098"],"GatheringItemLevel":["0","10"],"FishingRecordType":["0","44"]},"15846":{"Item":["0","52099"],"GatheringItemLevel":["0","10"],"FishingRecordType":["0","44"]},"15847":{"Item":["0","52100"],"GatheringItemLevel":["0","10"],"FishingRecordType":["0","44"]},"15848":{"Item":["0","52101"],"GatheringItemLevel":["0","10"],"FishingRecordType":["0","44"]},"15849":{"Item":["0","52102"],"GatheringItemLevel":["0","10"],"FishingRecordType":["0","44"]},"15850":{"Item":["0","52103"],"GatheringItemLevel":["0","10"],"FishingRecordType":["0","44"]},"15851":{"Item":["0","52104"],"GatheringItemLevel":["0","10"],"FishingRecordType":["0","44"]},"15852":{"Item":["0","52105"],"GatheringItemLevel":["0","10"],"FishingRecordType":["0","44"]},"15853":{"Item":["0","52106"],"GatheringItemLevel":["0","10"],"FishingRecordType":["0","44"]},"15854":{"Item":["0","52107"],"GatheringItemLevel":["0","10"],"FishingRecordType":["0","44"]},"15855":{"Item":["0","52108"],"GatheringItemLevel":["0","50"],"FishingRecordType":["0","44"]},"15856":{"Item":["0","52109"],"GatheringItemLevel":["0","50"],"FishingRecordType":["0","44"]},"15857":{"Item":["0","52110"],"GatheringItemLevel":["0","50"],"FishingRecordType":["0","44"]},"15858":{"Item":["0","52111"],"GatheringItemLevel":["0","50"],"FishingRecordType":["0","44"]},"15859":{"It